// nabbed.agent.v2 is the wire contract between nabbed-agent (data plane, on the
// user's hardware) and cloud-gateway (control plane). See design 0001.
//
// One bidirectional stream carries five kinds of traffic, each with its own
// delivery rule:
//
//   Session    both ways, in-band, per stream (Hello, Welcome, Heartbeat, GoAway)
//   Command    cloud -> agent, durable, ordered, at-least-once, idempotent by id
//   Query      cloud -> agent, interactive, never queued, no side effects
//   Event      agent -> cloud, at-least-once from the agent's outbox, acked
//   Telemetry  agent -> cloud, lossy, latest value per key wins

